2026-02-19 15:49:41,982 - INFO -    Initial: 0.6 (learned from first approval)
2026-02-19 15:49:41,982 - INFO -    After 1 use: 0.7 (user didn't reject suggestion)
2026-02-19 15:49:41,982 - INFO -    After 2 uses: 0.8 (pattern confirmed)
