💡 Confidence Decay:
2026-02-19 15:49:41,982 - INFO -    - If preference not used for 30 days: confidence -= 0.1
2026-02-19 15:49:41,982 - INFO -    - If user rejects suggestion: confidence -= 0.2
2026-02-19 15:49:41,982 - INFO -    - Minimum confidence: 0.3
