2026-02-19 15:49:42,007 - INFO - STEP 21: [PRUNING] RETENTION POLICIES
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO - Details: Different data types have different retention periods
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO - ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO - 
🗑️ Retention Policies:
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO -    1. Conversation Messages:
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO -       - Retention: 30 days
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO -       - Reason: Short-term context, summarized in session summaries
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO -       - Pruning: DELETE WHERE created_at < NOW() - INTERVAL '30 days'
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO - 
   2. Tool Usage Logs:
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO -       - Retention: 90 days
2026-02-19 15:49:42,008 - INFO -       - Reason: Analytics and debugging
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Pruning: DELETE WHERE created_at < NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days'
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO - 
   3. Prior Plans:
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Retention: Importance-based
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Keep if: reuse_count > 0 OR success_rating > 0.7
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Delete if: reuse_count = 0 AND created_at > 60 days
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Reason: Valuable plans are kept, unused plans deleted
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO - 
   4. User Preferences:
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Retention: Never deleted
2026-02-19 15:49:42,009 - INFO -       - Decay: Confidence score decreases if unused
2026-02-19 15:49:42,010 - INFO -       - Reason: Long-term user behavior patterns
2026-02-19 15:49:42,010 - INFO - 
   5. Session Summaries:
2026-02-19 15:49:42,011 - INFO -       - Retention: 1 year
2026-02-19 15:49:42,011 - INFO -       - Reason: Long-term context and patterns
2026-02-19 15:49:42,012 - INFO -       - Pruning: DELETE WHERE created_at < NOW() - INTERVAL '1 year'
2026-02-19 15:49:42,012 - INFO - 
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
